{#
  Confirmation of receipt of a cancellation (Abo-7, P62), to the customer, in
  the language of the order. § 312k Abs. 4 BGB wants the CONTENT of the
  declaration, the DATE AND TIME of receipt and the time the contract ends by
  it, at once and in text form — the mail repeats the declaration in full.

  An extraordinary cancellation has no end yet: the operator decides and the
  customer hears again (P57).

  Loaded as @Contao/mail/consho_cancellation_received.html.twig. Parameters are
  a LIST (vsprintf, see consho_payment_received.html.twig).

  Variables:
    order         the latest order of the subscription in InvoiceView's shape
    customer      {name, email}
    cancellation  {number, subscription, product, receivedAt (date and time
                  with zone), kind: ordinary|extraordinary, reason, name, email,
                  requestedAt ('' = earliest possible), effectiveAt ('' for an
                  extraordinary one), earliestApplied, earliestAt (formatted),
                  laterThanEarliest: the end lies after the earliest possible
                  one — periods beginning before it are billed in full (S1)}
    viewUrl       the order page, with a token; '' where the shop has none
#}
{% block subject %}{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.subject'|trans([cancellation.subscription], 'contao_default') }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% set font = 'font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #222222;' %}
{% set label = 'padding: 2px 16px 2px 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; font-weight: normal; color: #555555;' %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #f4f4f4;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_head.html.twig' %}
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; {{ font }}">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px 28px;">

<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.salutation'|trans([customer.name], 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.intro'|trans([cancellation.subscription], 'contao_default') }}</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.statement'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% include '@Contao/mail/_cancellation_statement.html.twig' with {cancellation: cancellation, font: font, label: label} only %}

{% if cancellation.kind == 'extraordinary' %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.pending'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% else %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;"><strong>{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.endsAt'|trans([cancellation.effectiveAt], 'contao_default') }}</strong></p>
{% if cancellation.earliestApplied %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.earliestApplied'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}
{% if cancellation.laterThanEarliest %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.cancellation.laterThanEarliest'|trans([cancellation.earliestAt], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if viewUrl %}
<p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">
    <a href="{{ viewUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #222222; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.viewOrder'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</a>
</p>
{% endif %}

</td></tr>
</table>
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_foot.html.twig' %}
</td></tr>
</table>
{% endblock %}
